        "text": "Page: 1964–65 European Cup Winners' Cup. Sentence: The season 1964–65 of the European Cup Winners' Cup football club tournament was won by West Ham United in a final at Wembley Stadium against 1860 Munich.\nPage: 1964–65 European Cup Winners' Cup. Sentence: West Ham's Bobby Moore was captaining a side that also included Geoff Hurst and Martin Peters just one season before all three went on to star in England's World Cup winning side of 1966.\nPage: Bobby Moore. Sentence: He is widely regarded as one of the greatest defenders of all time, and was cited by Pelé as the greatest defender that he had ever played against.",
